Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Harry, have you found a date for the Yule Ball yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't asked anyone yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.74,0:00:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you did ask someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.37,0:00:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's going with Cedric.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.99,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what, Harry,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.02,0:00:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,One Galleon says you won't ask Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Which Malfoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.26,0:00:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one at school, Ronald.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.36,0:00:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.80,0:00:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not asking Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.87,0:00:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the bet. You don't, we collect.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.20,0:00:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You do...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.61,0:00:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... then you've got a partner, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.67,0:01:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not going to say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.62,0:01:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on. Champion's privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.86,0:01:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The worse she can do is hex you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.61,0:01:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And she does that every Wednesday anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.85,0:01:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,See? It's no big deal. {Comments: AI garbage. [Kan] [Ba] [Mei] [Shen] [Me] [Da] [Bu] [Liao] [Te] = 看吧，没什么大不了的}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.61,0:01:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy, would you perhaps consider going to the Yule Ball-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.03,0:01:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.63,0:01:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't even know which one of us was asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.63,0:01:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But you don't even know which one of us was asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.01,0:01:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.98,0:01:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.41,0:01:42.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I a-err... I lost a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.82,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's get this over with.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.94,0:01:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna go to the Yule Ball with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.95,0:01:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No way. He actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be desperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.74,0:02:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this some kind of joke, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.40,0:02:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, going to the ball with a half blood like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.76,0:02:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.78,0:02:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.13,0:02:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,W... W-what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I said yes, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.17,0:02:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.75,0:02:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,An entire evening with you at my mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I possibly refuse?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.94,0:02:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you two realise what you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.55,0:02:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You do realise you're wearing a badge that says Potter stinks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can't resist the opportunity to torture you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.64,0:02:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going to embarass you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are even brave enough to follow through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What... y-you can't find a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been asked many times already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.17,0:03:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in those inferior specimens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The Malfoys have standards, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.79,0:03:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will make an exception for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is just irresistible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight o'clock on Christmas day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dress robes, not a Muggle dinner jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not whatever the Dursleys think is formal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.01,0:03:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you arrive smelling of broom polish,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall hex your shoes together and let you open the dance like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do we understand each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.70,0:03:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this, Potter!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.95,0:03:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And what did I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.28,0:03:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked Malfoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.43,0:03:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, mate,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Voldemort couldn't kill you, so you're trying something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.67,0:04:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait until her father finds out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.78,0:04:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter!!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe... it won't be that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.28,0:04:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he'll just want to make sure you look...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.98,0:04:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...respectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For the evening, Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ruin my daughter's evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,or humiliate her in front of the school,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,we shall have a conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.12,0:04:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.78,0:04:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all idiots?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry asked one of the prettiest girls in the school to the Yule Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,She rejected every single person who asked her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And she said yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.31,0:04:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the rest of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.98,0:04:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.49,0:05:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I already have a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You actually said yes to Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't start.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.46,0:05:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a point, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.89,0:05:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter isn't exactly a bad prospect.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.16,0:05:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.07,0:05:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,His family made a fortune in potion making.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.95,0:05:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,his grandfather invented Sleekeasy's Hair Potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.73,0:05:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what you use to straighten your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.57,0:05:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been putting Potter in your hair for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.50,0:05:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,If Black really named Potter his heir,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,he'll inherit a considerable part of the Black estate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.40,0:05:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How considerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.53,0:05:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough to rival some of the oldest pure blood families.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.11,0:05:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I knew!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.70,0:05:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That is not why I said yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the Potter family is absolutely loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.45,0:05:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's Sirius Black's heir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.11,0:06:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were only going with him to torture him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.98,0:06:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.65,0:06:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And those are the basic steps of ballroom dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:34.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.19,0:06:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Step forward, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.79,0:06:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're enjoying this, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Most indubitably. {Comment: AI garbage. [Le] = 乐. It's meant to be funny, that's why Neville cracks up laughing?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.00,0:06:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you two are attending the Yule Ball together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.95,0:06:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I suggest you start practising.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.07,0:06:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, take your positions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.21,0:07:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.84,0:07:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unusual to find one of our three champions-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.09,0:07:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,well, four- all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.72,0:07:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Something is troubling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And I suspect it's no longer the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.65,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked Malfoy to the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I- I thought she'd say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But she said yes, and now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Curious, isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.00,0:07:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since your first year, you and Malfoy have done nothing but clash.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.69,0:08:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet neither of you has managed to stay away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.49,0:08:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.70,0:08:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And... well, I'm not exactly easy, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But she hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.85,0:08:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why did she agree to go with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.83,0:08:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejecting you would have left you in a far worse predicament.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.32,0:08:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Without a partner for the ball, she helped you, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.15,0:08:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's a Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Half the time she argues with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,insults me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.89,0:08:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and the other half,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.86,0:08:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,she's trying to hex me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.80,0:08:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, she always finds her way back to you, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of the bond you've built over all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.24,0:08:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The arguments,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the disagreements,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.12,0:08:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the moments when you stood beside one another,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and all those times when neither of you could bring yourselves to walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.92,0:09:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Love is not always gentle, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.28,0:09:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.71,0:09:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it frightens us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.62,0:09:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes we spend years refusing to give it a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.63,0:09:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Love?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.22,0:09:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget that last part, my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of you knows how fortunate you are to have each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What have we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing. Mind your own business, Peeves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.76,0:10:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I suppose I won't tell you my little secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,about a certain young boy who's been practising all alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Practising what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.55,0:10:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me to mind my own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.74,0:10:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.01,0:10:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's awfully interested in Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.98,0:10:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Third floor. Empty classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But you didn't hear it from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.08,0:11:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.66,0:11:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.82,0:12:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.99,0:12:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Practising.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.84,0:12:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna make a fool of myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,or drag you down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.94,0:12:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've barely improved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd be better off going with someone-
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare finish that sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.31,0:12:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not doing this for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.13,0:12:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, I didn't mean to-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.79,0:13:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.03,0:14:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.95,0:14:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Your practice time is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to your dormitory, and-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.74,0:14:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Malfoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.66,0:14:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You can dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe all that practice finally paid off, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.87,0:15:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how did you know I was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.14,0:15:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, I just... it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.34,0:15:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.38,0:15:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I know we don't exactly get along, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.38,0:15:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad you're going to the ball with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.13,0:15:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wish you'd ask me because you wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.60,0:15:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.92,0:15:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You only asked because of a bet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.25,0:15:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,not because you wanted to go with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.09,0:15:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And... I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.74,0:15:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:47.47,Default,,0,0,0,,will you go to the ball with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But... we're already going together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.09,0:15:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm asking because I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.20,0:16:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna curse me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.89,0:16:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just close them, Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.57,0:16:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.94,0:16:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Did- did you just call me by my first name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.08,0:16:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to close them, or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.90,0:16:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.07,0:16:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.04,0:17:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You look ready to meet Minister Cornelius.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you look ready to meet his great great grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.89,0:18:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate you, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.06,0:18:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You've told me three times since we came downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.33,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.76,0:18:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,With that brick of a bloke?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.73,0:18:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.85,0:18:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the blokes, she picked that bricker Viktor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.42,0:18:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Could be worse. {Comments: AI garbage. [Ha] [Su] [Bu] [Li] could be = 还算不赖 [Hai suan bu lai]}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry, are you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry... are you staring at Malfoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.47,0:18:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.55,0:18:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We only wanted to tease Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...because he got picked for the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.58,0:19:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And now he's staring at Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.56,0:19:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.28,0:19:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to keep staring, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.17,0:19:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You just look... beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.60,0:19:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.62,0:19:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Malfoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.82,0:19:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:45.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You must lead the opening dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready, Potter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you ever imagine it, Albus?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.51,0:20:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A Gryffindor and a Slytherin dancing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.55,0:20:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So many years, so many students.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.85,0:20:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,, I can't ever recall seeing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.21,0:20:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.18,0:20:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at Cho.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at Granger, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.38,0:21:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And I promise,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.94,0:21:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,tonight, my eyes are only for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.47,0:22:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.37,0:22:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.88,0:23:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They haven't noticed, have they?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.77,0:24:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody wants to interrupt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.44,0:25:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe we didn't notice everyone had stopped dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.96,0:25:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So... does that mean we're...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.06,0:25:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...friends now?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.24,0:25:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I always thought you hated me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.42,0:25:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.62,0:25:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I still can't forgive you for what happened to Hagrid's dragon,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.54,0:25:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,or the things you've said to Hermione,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.58,0:25:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.35,0:26:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.54,0:26:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I don't think tonight would've been this wonderful with anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.93,0:26:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't trade it for anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.02,0:26:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Or anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.50,0:26:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.38,0:26:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've been pretty awful to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.33,0:26:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I guess tonight you showed me there's more to you than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.72,0:26:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.23,0:26:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.78,0:26:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.78,0:26:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Being so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.66,0:26:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've attacked you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.76,0:26:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,insulted you,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.04,0:26:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,gotten you into trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.98,0:26:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.73,0:26:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.18,0:26:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe because... when I was little,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.50,0:26:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,people treated me that way my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.07,0:26:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can't do that to anyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.30,0:26:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,because I know how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.79,0:27:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.41,0:27:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I see you without your glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.16,0:27:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.75,0:27:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.10,0:27:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.55,0:27:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.24,0:27:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not to ruin the moment, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.10,0:27:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't really see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.62,0:27:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.03,0:27:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,please don't look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.79,0:27:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our little secret, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.49,0:27:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy...?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.88,0:28:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Malfoy, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.19,0:28:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only supposed to go the ball with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.85,0:28:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I've kept my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.18,0:28:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.69,0:28:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to go back to being...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.77,0:28:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...who we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.58,0:28:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She kept my glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.23,0:28:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My old glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.46,0:29:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.73,0:29:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No... you need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.68,0:29:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.27,0:29:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.30,0:29:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Father... what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.32,0:29:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Saving you life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.27,0:30:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It- it was just the Yule Ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing else happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.58,0:30:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.19,0:30:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll take the champions' partners into the lake for the next task.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.73,0:30:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how many have died in those waters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.52,0:30:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And the things I've had to endure hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.39,0:30:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.17,0:30:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've disappointed me, Draconia.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.49,0:30:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not who you think he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.47,0:30:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We were wrong about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.23,0:30:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.70,0:30:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's an order!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.58,0:30:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But I love him!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.40,0:30:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What did I do to deserve a daughter like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.61,0:30:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.69,0:30:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.86,0:31:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.45,0:31:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Ron and Hermione?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.99,0:31:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find them anywher-
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.92,0:31:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother me, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.05,0:31:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Draconia?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.59,0:31:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hogwarts tournament attendant,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.40,0:31:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,please take your seats with the supporters of your chosen champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.75,0:31:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.62,0:31:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Or you'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.29,0:31:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.15,0:31:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You've disappointed me, Draconia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.94,0:31:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But I love him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.03,0:32:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has reached the Cup!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.47,0:32:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And the winner is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.27,0:32:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Voldemort has returned!
